OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and clear spells,
OL,7,Falthough still the chance of isolated
OL,8,Fthundery showers. Feeling warm and
OL,9,Frather muggy for most, especially in
OL,10,Furban areas. Winds mainly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FVariable cloud and isolated
OL,13,Fthundery showers possible at first but
OL,14,Fbecoming generally dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells. A fresher day compared to
OL,16,Frecently, but still hot in the south.
OL,17,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
